# Web roadmap (spbpu-booking)

Work from `develop`. Branch prefix: `feature/web/...` (backend-only: `feature/backend/...`).
One PR per step; merge to `develop` before starting the next from fresh `develop`.

## Order

0. **`feature/web/real-api`** (current) — no mock short-circuit; login/rooms/bookings hit real backend
1. **`feature/web/search`** — room search from `GET /api/v1/rooms` (+ available by slot)
2. **`feature/web/account`** — cabinet: real requests/bookings, cancel
3. **`feature/web/schedule`** — calendar from real bookings/occupancy
4. **`feature/web/booking`** — create request from site (`POST /booking-requests`)
5a. **`feature/backend/admin-rooms`** — room CRUD API for admin
5b. **`feature/web/admin-panel`** — admin UI on real moderation + room CRUD

Auth (web+bot) and Telegram bot are done; do not re-open unless fixing regressions.
